      "notation": "health-worker",
      "description": "The generic DAK persona who delivers care at the point of care and records it on a device: completes the DAK's SDC forms and acts on its decision-support guidance (`questionnaire-data-capture.bpmn`, `act-on-decision-support.bpmn`). A DAK's own health-worker roles (a vaccinator, a community health worker) carry these skills or inherit this role. WHO's DAK personas call this a health worker; the role is a lane, never a person.",
